    <h1 class="slide__heading">How We Build</h1>
    <p class="lede">What we're building, and why we build it ourselves.</p>
    <p>Every element, down to each individually hung jellyfish, is months of planning by people who care far too much about it.</p>
    <p>Here is what that actually means.</p>
  </div>
